OL,3,GNEWSABuskers wanted ` but first, a
OL,4,Asound check
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore buskers are wanted on the streets
OL,7,Fof Lincolnshire ` but they will have to
OL,8,Fget the local council's seal of
OL,9,Fapproval first.
OL,11,FIt is hoped bringing musicians to
OL,12,Fmarkets in Spalding, Holbeach, Crowland
OL,13,Fand Long Sutton will entertain shoppers
OL,14,Fand help bring the towns to life.
OL,16,FTo secure a booking, "talented buskers"
OL,17,Fwill have to submit footage of
OL,18,Fthemselves performing.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
