OL,3,GNEWSABuskers wanted ` but first, a
OL,4,Asound check
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo does the local authority have a
OL,7,FSimon Cowell waiting with a golden
OL,8,Fbuzzer? Not at all, says Councillor
OL,9,FNick Worth, but "we want to see maybe
OL,10,Fsome video of where they've been
OL,11,Fbefore, so we know what they're capable
OL,12,Fof".
